The unified battery drew a pill with the digits inside. It now draws
the Budík status bar battery (export/icons/statusbar stat_sys_battery_*):
an outline with its terminal, a level fill and a bolt while charging,
with the percentage (when it is switched on) next to it in Instrument
Sans with tabular figures. Size, colours for light and dark areas,
low battery and power save colours and the content description stay
those of the unified battery; colours are read while drawing.
